        "exam_code": "PRO192_SU26_FE",
        "content": "Consider the code:\n\n```\ninterface A {\n    void methodA();\n}\n```\n\n```\ninterface B {\n    void methodB();\n}\n```\n\n```\nclass C implements A, B {\n    public void methodA() {\n        System.out.print(\"A\");\n    }\n```\n\n```\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        C obj = new C();\n        obj.methodA();\n        obj.methodB();\n    }\n```\n\n}\nWhat will the output be?",
        "explanation": null,
        "image_url": null,
        "type": "text",
        "chapter_name": "Tổng hợp",
        "correct_answer": "A",
        "is_multi": false,
