        "content": "Given this Wage interface:\n\n```\npublic interface Wage {\n    default void notice() {\n        System.out.println(\"Executing ...\");\n    }\n    void increase();\n}\n```\n\nGiven this Employee class:\n\n```\npublic class Employee implements Wage {\n    private String id;\n    private String name;\n    private int salary;\n```\n\n```\n    public Employee(String id, String name) {\n        this.id = id;\n        this.name = name;\n        this.salary = 1000;\n    }\n```\n\n```\n    @Override\n    public void notice() {\n        System.out.println(\"Employee salary computed!\");\n    }\n```\n\n```\n    @Override\n    public void increase() {\n        this.salary += 200;\n    }\n```\n\n```\n    public int getSalary() {\n        return salary;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nand this main method:\n\n```\npublic static void main(String[] args) {\n    Employee e = new Employee(\"EMP101\", \"John Doe\");\n    try {\n        e.increase();\n        System.out.println(\"Salary: \" + e.getSalary());\n}\ncatch (Exception ex) {\n        System.out.println(\"Cannot increase/decrease salary.\");\n}\nfinally {\n        e.notice();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhat will be printed on the screen after running the main method?",
